# The third, fourth and fifth battles won (stages 2-4), from a save the
# original wrote, to a save the original writes for the next script.
# set: campaign
# start-save: REVENGE_ORIGINAL_SAVE
# Load Game, slot 1 (as old_save.keys), then the second battle (stage 1) with
# each message answered by its first choice, which wins it, and its story.
idle:1000 Return idle:50 Right idle:50 Return idle:300
Return idle:600
Return idle:6000
Return still:2000 Return still:2000 Return still:2000 Return still:2000
Return still:2000 Return still:2000 Return still:2000 Return still:2000
Return still:2000 Return still:2000 Return still:2000 Return still:2000
Return still:2000
# Stage 2 (SCENE3), won the same way; its story; the menu.
Return idle:6000 @snap:stage2_menu
# Stage 3 (SCENE4): the lance moved 20 cells east at once, out of the way of
# the enemy's heavy unit; it is won when the enemy withdraws.
Return steps:1 Return idle:300 Return idle:300      # Continue; the commands; Move
Right idle:30 Right idle:30 Right idle:30 Right idle:30 Right idle:30
Right idle:30 Right idle:30 Right idle:30 Right idle:30 Right idle:30
Right idle:30 Right idle:30 Right idle:30 Right idle:30 Right idle:30
Right idle:30 Right idle:30 Right idle:30 Right idle:30 Right idle:30
idle:100 Return idle:300 @snap:stage3_route Return idle:300 Return idle:300
steps:8 @snap:stage3_step08 steps:8 @snap:stage3_step16
still:2000 @snap:stage3_contact Return
still:2000 @snap:stage3_won Return
still:2000 @snap:stage3_story Return
still:2000 @snap:stage3_menu Return                  # Continue
still:2000 @snap:stage4_story1 Return
still:2000 @snap:stage4_story2 Return
# Stage 4 (SCENE5): the ammunition carrier the lance escorts, driven at flank
# speed to (49,95) before the enemy reaches it; won there at 17:45.
still:2000 @snap:stage4_battle
Return steps:1 Return idle:300 Down idle:300 Return idle:300 Return idle:300
Up idle:300 Return idle:300                         # Flank Speed; Move
PageDown idle:30 PageDown idle:30 PageDown idle:30 PageDown idle:30 PageDown idle:30
PageDown idle:30 PageDown idle:30 PageDown idle:30 PageDown idle:30 PageDown idle:30
PageDown idle:30 PageDown idle:30 PageDown idle:30 PageDown idle:30 PageDown idle:30
PageDown idle:30 PageDown idle:30
Right idle:30 Right idle:30 idle:100 @snap:stage4_cursor
Return idle:300 @snap:stage4_route Return idle:300 @snap:stage4_commands
Return idle:300 @snap:stage4_ordered               # Done
still:2000 @snap:stage4_moving Return
still:2000 @snap:stage4_arrived Return
still:2000 @snap:stage4_won Return
still:2000 @snap:stage4_menu                        # the menu after the stage
Down idle:50 Down idle:50 Return idle:300 @snap:slots  # Save & Continue
Return idle:300 @snap:save1 Return idle:300 @snap:save2 Return idle:600 @snap:saved
